n":"The Thirty Years\' War ended with the Peace of Westphalia in 1648, a settlement that reshaped the political map of Central Europe.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5523-7127-8eec-52729ba0573f","description":"The Thirty Years\' War","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5523-7660-8fa4-e4993c51963f","description":"The Hundred Years\' War","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5523-735c-990f-d5fcbc490fa7","description":"The War of the Roses","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5523-7a35-ad13-447657b0d969","description":"The War of Spanish Succession","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5523-73b0-8c64-e6f98a2f2cac","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7ebc-94f2-41649ebfcaca","question":"Germany\'s allies in World War I were Austria-Hungary, Bulgaria and which other state?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"The Ottoman Empire joined the Central Powers in 1914 and fought Allied forces at Gallipoli and across the Middle East.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5523-79c9-a8b4-c9b0463236f2","description":"The Ottoman Empire","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5523-7ab3-912c-5c06e2ace968","description":"Italy","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5523-72ea-bdbb-62d9b0cd84af","description":"Russia","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5523-75ca-9123-f799b8f6ae1f","description":"Spain","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5523-74c7-9d41-b15869deb57e","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7ebc-94f2-41649ebfcaca","question":"What war was the USA involved in between 1950 and 1953?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"The Korean War ended in an armistice in 1953, not a formal peace treaty, so the peninsula remains divided.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5523-77a6-802d-c51fef526971","description":"Korean War","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5523-7a7a-bee0-eaf692f44b26","description":"Vietnam War","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5523-766f-8c06-cc9cebcec9a1","description":"World War I","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5523-7c41-9176-c33111d704f8","description":"World War II","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5523-70c0-a426-6920e2d10b08","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7ebc-94f2-41649ebfcaca","question":"What was the nickname given to the possible computer bug that caused worldwide concern leading up to the year 2000?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Y2K concerns centered on whether software using two-digit years would treat \u201c00\u201d as 1900 instead of 2000, potentially disrupting computer systems.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5523-7e2f-9d4c-dc519356406b","description":"Y2K","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5523-72c0-9903-efda7ff7a7a4","description":"Bug2000","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5523-7288-96d6-0af1fed32339","description":"Trojan Horse","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5523-7ee2-9bee-2c391ec86f82","description":"The Millennial Worm","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5523-7c94-840b-e630470f8577","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7ebc-94f2-41649ebfcaca","question":"In which country was Adolf Hitler born?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Adolf Hitler was born in Braunau am Inn, Austria, in 1889, when the country was part of the Austro-Hungarian Empire.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5523-759b-b2c9-c96a299b9e27","description":"Austria","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5523-7c53-bd06-03aa137ce440","description":"Germany","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5523-75ad-981a-3fbd98d2d34d","description":"Belgium","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5523-7c88-a053-16f421bc5697","description":"Switzerland","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5523-7995-92cd-ec04608f822c","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7ebc-94f2-41649ebfcaca","question":"Which French king was married to Marie Antoinette?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Louis XVI was executed by guillotine in 1793; Marie Antoinette was executed later that year.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5523-752c-9dfd-86ecc8fd5279","description":"Louis XVI","cor